 * 
 * @section dev_class_diag_summary Summary
 * 
 * Device class diagram shows class inheritance hierarchy, dependencies and associations of 
 * each unique SDR device supported by Lime Suite NG library.
 * 
 * All SDR device class implementations support the universal device control and configuration interface - ``SDRDevice``.
 * All SDR device classes based on a LMS7002M chip control interface share a common set of device control and configuration
 * functions. Additionally, each unique SDR device class implementation can override control and configuration functions to
 * implement device specific control and configuration functionality. Some device classes also override common FPGA interface 
 * and implement device specific FPGA functions to account for differences in FPGA control and configuration.
 * 
 * All device LMS7002M, FPGA and other onboard device register control and configuration is done via the ``ISerialPort`` interface.
 * Each unique SDR device class overrides the virtual serial interface with device specific serial port implementation.
 * 
 * LimeSDR_MMX8 device class is an exception from all of the device class implementations. This device class implementation overrides
 * device functions to target control and configuration of onboard devices that are based on the XTRX device class implementation.
 * 
 * @subsection dev_class_legend Diagram legend
 * 
 * Link definitions:
 * 
 * - Solid line with a transparent arrow head body - Inheritance
 * - Dotted line with simple arrow head - Dependency
 * - Solid line with simple arrow head - Association
 * 
 */